  "title": "Nvidia and OpenAI in Talks for $250 Billion Backstop to Fund AI Infrastructure Plans",
  "summary": "Nvidia and OpenAI are in talks to secure a $250 billion backstop to fund AI infrastructure projects, potentially revitalizing the tech-bubble surrounding their partnership. The backstop could allow OpenAI to raise capital for a data center campus in Pike County, Ohio. Nvidia has also announced a $1.5 billion investment in SoftBank's data center developer, with the goal of ensuring its chips power an OpenAI data center.",
